      "content": "idk i dont know if i can just \"introduce myself\" to everyone. it feels so exhausting. like i'm putting in all this effort to be seen and it's just... nothing. it feels like i'm just wasting my breath and space. it would be so much easier if i could just stop existing, you know? just stop being a burden to everyone even if i don't know them.",
